[break] corpus-verify-accepts-any-size
rule: A corpus whose size is not the pin's is refused: a line ending that changed is a different size.
file: crates/cortex-testkit/src/corpus/shared.rs
in: verify
find: if found.bytes != pin.bytes {
replace: if false {
caught-by:
    cortex-testkit corpus::tests::a_line_ending_that_changed_is_refused

[break] corpus-verify-accepts-any-count
rule: A corpus with a file missing, or one that is not meant to be there, is refused by its count.
