in: verify
find: if found.files != pin.files {
replace: if false {
caught-by:
    cortex-testkit corpus::tests::a_missing_file_is_refused
    cortex-testkit corpus::tests::an_extra_file_is_refused_even_when_empty

[break] corpus-verify-accepts-a-folder-that-is-not-there
rule: A corpus that is not there is refused, not measured as empty.
file: crates/cortex-testkit/src/corpus/shared.rs
in: verify
find: if !dir.is_dir() {
replace: if false {
caught-by:
    cortex-testkit corpus::tests::a_folder_that_is_not_there_is_refused

[break] corpus-real-code-checks-the-repositorys-pin-whatever-it-is-asked
rule: A corpus is checked against the pin it is asked for.
file: crates/cortex-testkit/src/corpus.rs
in: try_real_code_in
find: shared::verify(&folder, pin)
replace: shared::verify(&folder, &Pin::pinned())
caught-by:
    cortex-testkit corpus::tests::a_corpus_that_is_not_fetched_or_not_whole_fails_with_the_command_that_fetches_it

# ----------------------------------------------------------- the pin's text

[break] corpus-pin-takes-a-key-twice
rule: A pin that gives a key twice is refused.
