[break] corpus-pin-takes-a-short-hash
rule: A pin's hash is sixteen digits, so that a cut-off line is not taken for a hash.
file: crates/cortex-testkit/src/corpus/shared.rs
in: parse_hash
find: if value.len() != 16 {
